/Producer (yks\055web scripts\057stamp\055paper\055pdf\056py)
/Title (Capacity Sourcing\072 Cloud Identity Is Not the Lever)
/Author (Justin H\056 Kuiper\054 CISSP)
/Subject (The dominant operating\055model debate in agentic systems treats cloud identity \204 which hyperscaler holds the account\054 which region invoices the workload\054 which IAM surface fronts the resources \204 as the strategic lever for capacity\056 This paper argues that the framing is a category error\056 The cloud account is the invoicing surface\073 it is not the capacity surface\056 Where compute actually comes from in 2026 is determined upstream of the account by a six\055layer stack\072 silicon fabrication allocation\054 acce)
/Keywords (capacity\055sourcing\054 managing\055agentics\055ops\054 cloud\055identity\054 silicon\055allocation\054 accelerator\055allocation\054 hyperscaler\055buildouts\054 sovereignty\054 hgc3ae2)
/Creator (yks\055web scripts\057stamp\055paper\055pdf\056py)
/CopyrightStatus (Protected)
/Copyright (\251 2026 Non Sequitur Publishing\056 All rights reserved\056)
/MarkedContent (True)
>>
